      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happened to me and a friend on both 1137 and 1140 in FreeSessionRoom (wrld_8cf5236d-8c42-4737-a540-23743f9a7a4b) while a video was playing. My friend with weaker hardware froze rather quickly, I could stay in the world for a bit longer before freezing. Certain actions, like clicking on an avatar in the avatars menu seemed to trigger the freeze somewhat reliably.\nThere were non-beta users in the instance at the same time, and they were not affected.\nThis is the only world where video player affected me (or anyone I know) like that - perhaps it was set to stream player by default?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
